---
// A slim pointer to the faith-based communicators page. That work is strong
// but speaks to a different buyer, so the homepage only signposts it.
---

<section class="bg-gls-green-dark px-4 py-6 text-white">
  <a
    href="/faith-based-communicators/"
    class="group mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-center sm:flex-row"
  >
    <span class="text-white/85">We also help thoughtful, faith-based communicators reach larger audiences.</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-heading font-bold text-gls-yellow">
      See that work
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        fill="currentColor"
        class="h-4 w-4 transition motion-safe:group-hover:translate-x-1"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          fill-rule="evenodd"
          d="M3 10a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h10.69l-3.22-3.22a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H3.75A.75.75 0 0 1 3 10Z"
          clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </a>
</section>
